| `POST /api/v1/bookings` 🔑 | Hold seats | 201 |
| `PUT /api/v1/bookings/{id}/coupon` | Apply a coupon | 200 |
| `DELETE /api/v1/bookings/{id}/coupon` | Remove the coupon | 200 |
| `POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/release` | Let the hold go | 200 |
